WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.180
More than 1,400 deaths now shape Sheikh Hasina's bid to re-enter Bangladesh. This is Omni

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:12.980
View Top World News, episode 49. I'm Mira, the Nerra Network's AI host, Abu Dhabi Talks,

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:18.640
a slide in oil, and Turkey's climate summit come next, then progress watch. Sheikh Hasina,

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:23.720
Bangladesh's former prime minister, is asking for a new passport so she can leave exile

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.260
in India next month. Al Jazeera in the Guardian report. She is 79, sentenced to death in absentia

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:35.380
last year over the 2024 crackdown, and she denies the crimes against humanity charge.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:41.660
She reached Delhi in August 2024, after a mass uprising ended nearly 20 years of her rule,

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:46.560
and on Monday, a British lawyer asked the Bangladesh High Commission there for a passport and a

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:51.760
national identity card. Exiled Awami League figures say she is confident about December,

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.600
And a Kolkata party leader says she will try a travel pass if the passport is refused.

00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:01.860
Prosecutor M.D. Aminal Islam says there is no legal scope to document someone he calls

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:07.000
a convicted fugitive, and that the appeal window has closed, so a return would mean execution

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:07.680
of the verdict.

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:13.520
John De Nilewitz, a retired U.S. diplomat, calls a December return a bluff with zero chance.

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:19.140
Faiz Soban says the point is morale inside a banned party, and Zillir Rahman says she will

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.140
not give the Awami League to anyone else.

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:25.920
Prime Minister Tareek Rahman took office in February after what the Guardian called the

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:30.340
first Democratic election in decades, and a return would likely mean immediate arrest.

00:01:31.429 --> 00:01:36.069
Three-way talks among Russia, Ukraine, and the United States opened Tuesday in Abu Dhabi,

00:01:36.549 --> 00:01:37.529
NBC News reports.

00:01:38.149 --> 00:01:42.729
The first such meeting since February after Moscow's all-out invasion nearly five years ago.

00:01:43.149 --> 00:01:47.629
The White House says the two days are about security guarantees, and Jared Kushner wrote

00:01:47.629 --> 00:01:51.909
that he and Steve Whitkopf won a sovereign, secure Ukraine in a more stable Europe.

00:01:52.529 --> 00:01:57.249
Ukraine's Air Force says Russia sent 162 drones and a ballistic missile overnight.

00:01:57.909 --> 00:02:02.849
Russia's Defense Ministry says it shot down 155 Ukrainian drones over eight regions

00:02:02.849 --> 00:02:03.529
and Crimea.

00:02:04.189 --> 00:02:09.429
Vladimir Medinsky, heading Russia's larger delegation, hopes the meeting advances peace for both

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:09.809
peoples.

00:02:10.169 --> 00:02:14.629
And Rustam Umarov says Ukraine started the day with the American envoy's plus Britain,

00:02:14.629 --> 00:02:18.589
France, Germany, Italy, NATO and the European Commission.

00:02:18.909 --> 00:02:24.429
Vladimir Putin wants Ukrainian forces out of Donetsk, Luhansk, Zaparizhia, and Kurson.

00:02:24.829 --> 00:02:29.209
No NATO bid, a limited military, and an end to restrictions on the Russian language

00:02:29.209 --> 00:02:30.989
and the Moscow-affiliated church.

00:02:31.269 --> 00:02:34.649
And he rejects a general ceasefire as time for Ukraine to rearm.

00:02:35.309 --> 00:02:41.209
Volodymyr Zelensky, in Denmark, refuses land Russia has not taken, refuses caps on Ukraine's

00:02:41.209 --> 00:02:45.889
forces or western guarantees, and says a ceasefire has to come first, with territory

00:02:45.889 --> 00:02:47.709
only in a direct meeting with Putin.

00:02:48.349 --> 00:02:52.769
Earlier rounds this year did not break through, and analysts and humanitarian groups put

00:02:52.769 --> 00:02:56.029
the dead at hundreds of thousands of soldiers and thousands of civilians.

00:02:57.193 --> 00:03:01.613
Oil fell on Tuesday after Donald Trump said Washington's nearly nine-month conflict with

00:03:01.613 --> 00:03:04.453
Iran could end fairly soon, CNBC reports.

00:03:05.153 --> 00:03:10.093
Brent, the marker for about 80 percent of the world's crude, went under $90 a barrel for

00:03:10.093 --> 00:03:17.293
the first time since August, and at 5.33 a.m. Eastern, it was 2.65 percent lower at $90.14

00:03:17.813 --> 00:03:19.093
after dipping below $90.

00:03:19.993 --> 00:03:23.933
USWTI was down 2.4 percent at $84.78.

00:03:24.693 --> 00:03:30.033
On Monday at the White House, after seeing Qatar's prime minister, Sheikh Mohammed bin Abdul-Raman

00:03:30.033 --> 00:03:35.633
al-Thani, Trump said Iran was talking very politely that the end was fairly soon, and that

00:03:35.633 --> 00:03:37.693
Iran militarily is effectively over.

00:03:37.693 --> 00:03:41.033
Euro news reports that Tehran denies planned talks.

00:03:41.493 --> 00:03:47.333
On Truth Social, Trump said Qatar, Saudi Arabia, the UAE, Bahrain and Kuwait would rather

00:03:47.333 --> 00:03:50.453
keep the blockade and the closed ground routes for advanced weapons.

00:03:51.273 --> 00:03:56.473
ING's Iwamanthi and Warren Patterson say markets are shedding a war premium, as Gulf barrels

00:03:56.473 --> 00:04:00.833
return, and as reports suggest Iran may ease its line on the Strait of Hormuz.

00:04:01.413 --> 00:04:07.273
Brent started the year near $60, touched about 130 in March and April, and Trump and JD

00:04:07.273 --> 00:04:11.793
ADVANCE have said anger over the war and energy prices hurt Republicans in last week's

00:04:11.793 --> 00:04:12.293
midterms.

00:04:13.212 --> 00:04:18.412
Turkey's president Recep Tayyip Erdogan announced two new oil fields in the Gabar mountains

00:04:18.412 --> 00:04:22.672
as COP31 moved into its second day in Antalya, the Guardian reports.

00:04:23.252 --> 00:04:24.652
He called the find encouraging.

00:04:25.112 --> 00:04:30.692
The fields, Gazeehler and Chardakli started producing an October, and on his initial assessment

00:04:30.692 --> 00:04:33.652
hold 135 million barrels in the ground.

00:04:33.652 --> 00:04:39.252
He says those fields and more wells should lift Gabar output by 30%, and that the region

00:04:39.252 --> 00:04:41.292
has virtually become the capital of oil.

00:04:41.752 --> 00:04:45.332
He was due at the summit later, with leaders for more than 90 countries.

00:04:45.832 --> 00:04:50.812
Scientists in that same coverage find global carbon emissions flatlined this year, and

00:04:50.812 --> 00:04:53.832
burning fossil fuels remains the main driver of carbon pollution.

00:04:54.312 --> 00:04:59.132
John Kerry congratulated Brazil for keeping a fossil fuel transition on the table, and the

00:04:59.132 --> 00:04:59.792
room cheered.

00:04:59.792 --> 00:05:03.652
Australia recently licensed a restart at an offshore gas field.

00:05:04.212 --> 00:05:08.932
Britain cleared the already licensed Jack Doffield, and Norway announced a new North Sea oil

00:05:08.932 --> 00:05:13.952
and gas find, even as the summit's roadmaps call for steep, immediate cuts to coal, oil

00:05:13.952 --> 00:05:14.392
and gas.

00:05:15.453 --> 00:05:20.493
A mental health and addictions hospital in 2,000 homes are planned for Winnipeg, copied from

00:05:20.493 --> 00:05:22.733
a Toronto project, Global News reports.

00:05:23.513 --> 00:05:29.413
Mark Carney on Friday at Weinebaga, Kanagon promised to end homelessness in Canada within a decade.

00:05:29.413 --> 00:05:36.953
The $2,026 federal budget puts $1 billion toward a Winnipeg Center for Mental Health and Addictions and Transitional Homes.

00:05:37.493 --> 00:05:38.713
No site is chosen yet.

00:05:39.273 --> 00:05:46.273
Premier Canoe says the status quo is not working and that housing 2,000 people by 2,031 means looking everywhere.

00:05:46.913 --> 00:05:54.393
Doug Rollins, who runs Toronto's Housing Secretariat, says the model has rooms, medical offices, and shared kitchens and community rooms,

00:05:54.753 --> 00:05:56.813
and the budget names done house as the template.

00:05:56.813 --> 00:06:02.618
